return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'yo','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:46+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Ó kó ohun ìpamọ́ agbègbè media ojula yìí lọ sí ibi ìpamọ́ ohun kan ti Zinn® ó sì ń fi ránṣẹ́ láti CDN kan. A tọ́jú rẹ̀ lẹ́gbẹ̀ẹ́ ìṣàkóso Zinn® rẹ — kò sí bọ́tìnì àbẹwọlé kan tí a tẹ́ sínú WordPress rí.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'A ti fi pamọ́. Tẹ iye tuntun rẹ̀ láti rọ́pò rẹ̀.','Filter this list…'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí…','Filter this list'=>'Ṣe àlẹmọ àkójọ yìí','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Ko si ohun ti o ba àlẹmọ yẹn mu.','Add a row'=>'Fi rọ́wọ̀ kún un','Remove this row'=>'Yọ ila yii kuro','Remove'=>'Yọ kuro','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — àkópọ̀','Overview'=>'Àkótán','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Gbogbo plug-in Zinn® lori aaye yii, ati boya o n ṣiṣẹ.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ko si asopọ ti o nilo fun plugin yii.','Open settings'=>'Ṣí ètò','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'O ko ni aṣẹ lati yi awọn eto wọnyi pada.','Settings sections'=>'Àwọn apá ìṣètò','Support'=>'Atilẹyin','Save changes'=>'Fipamọ awọn ayipada','Tools'=>'Àwọn irinṣẹ','Export settings'=>'Awọn eto igbasilẹ wọle','Reset to defaults'=>'Tún sí àwọn àbájáde ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ pàápàá','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Èyí yóò mú gbogbo ìtò ní etò yìí padà sí ipò àkọ́kọ́ wọn. Ṣé o fẹ́ tẹ̀ síwájú?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Àwọn ohun àyẹ̀wò fún ìtìlẹ́yìn','Import a settings file'=>'Gbe faili àwọn êtò wọlé','Import'=>'Wọlé','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Àwọn fáìlì tí wọ́n kó jáde kò ní àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ aṣínà (passwords), àwọn àmì ìdámọ̀ (tokens) tàbí àwọn bọ́tìnnì API — wọ́n máa nílò kí o tún tẹ́ wọ́n sínú lórí ojú òpó tuntun náà.','Settings saved.'=>'A ti fi àwọn ẹ̀rọ ìṣètò pamọ́.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Gbogbo ètò lori plugin yii ti padà sí ipo rẹ̀ akọkọ.','Done.'=>'Ó ti tán.','That action is not available.'=>'Iṣẹ yẹn ko si.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'A ko le ka faili yẹn. Yan faili awọn eto ti a gbe wọ jade lati inu plọọgi-in Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Fáìlì náà tóbi jù láti jẹ́ ìfiránṣẹ́ ètò.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Fáìlì yẹn kò ṣe ojúlówó ìṣètò ìj✕t Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'A fi fáìlì yẹn sọ kalẹ̀ láti inú plọ́gìn mìíràn (%s), nítorí náà rírù ú wọlé síbí yóò tọ́jú àwọn ètò tí plọ́gìn yìí kò mọ̀.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Ìtòjọ %d ni a gbé wọlé. Àwọn ọ̀rọ̀ ìkọ̀wé àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì API kì í wà nínú ìbéèrè ìgbejáde, nítorí náà tẹ wọ́n sílẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® kò dá àmì ìdánimọ̀ kan padà. Kò sí ohun tí a yí padà lórí ojula yí.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'A ko ti sopọ aaye yii mọ si gbigbe media Zinn® jade. Awọn ikojọpọ tuntun yoo wa sori server yii. Tun so pọ lẹẹkan si lati daṣibọọdu Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® fesi pẹlu HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Zinn Digital® ti ge asopọ.','Connected'=>'Ti sopọ','Connecting…'=>'À ń pọ̀ mọ́ ọn…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Ti sopọ, ṣugbọn nkan kan nilo akiyesi','Not connected'=>'Kò sopọ̀','Running on your own account'=>'Ṣíṣe lórí àkáǹtì ara rẹ','We could not check this'=>'A kò le ṣe ayẹ̀wò èyí','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Kò sọ ìdí tí kò fi ṣẹlẹ̀ bẹ́ẹ̀. Firanṣẹ́ ìjábọ̀ àyẹ̀wò kan, a ó sì wo o.','Connection status'=>'Ipò àsopọ̀','Last checked %s ago.'=>'A yẹàyẹ̀ kẹ́yìn ní %s sẹ́yìn.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(ó sí ní taba tuntun)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Fi è ránṣẹ́ sí àtìlẹ́yìn Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Èyí gan-an ni ohun tí a ó fi ránṣẹ́ — kò sí ohun mìíràn, kò sí ohun tí ó fi pamọ́. Àwọn ọrọ̀ aṣínà rẹ, àwọn àmì àṣẹ (tokens), àti àwọn bọ́tìnnì API rẹ kò sí nínú rẹ̀.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ìròyìn àyẹ̀wò tí a ó ránṣẹ́','Copy to clipboard'=>'Daako si pátákó ìkọ́pamọ́','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Fi ìròyìn yìí ranṣẹ sí àtìlẹyìn Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'A ṣí tìkẹ́tì àtìlẹ́yìn fún ọ, a sì ń dáhùn nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì. Bí o bá fẹ́ràn kí o má ṣe fi í ránṣẹ́, da ẹ̀kọ́ rẹ̀ sí òkè, kí o sì lẹ́ mọ́ inú tìkẹ́tì fúnra rẹ̀.','Copied'=>'Àwọn ẹ̀dà rẹ̀ ti dá','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'A ko le de ọdọ Zinn Digital® lati sevha yii (%s). Da iroyin oke kọ silẹ ki o si ṣi silẹ tiketi kan dipo — ko si ohun ti ko tọ si awọn eto rẹ.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Atileyin Zinn® ti gba iroyin rẹ yoo si fesi nipasẹ imeeli.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Ìtìlẹ́yìn Zinn® ti gba ìròyìn rẹ — ìtọ́kasí %s — yóò sì fèsì nípasẹ̀ ímeèlì.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'O ti fi ọ̀pọ̀lọpọ̀ ìjábọ̀ ránṣẹ́ láàárín àkókò kúkúrú. Dúró fún ìṣẹ́jú mélòó kan kí o sì tún gbiyanju rẹ̀ lẹ́ẹ̀kan si — àwọn tí tẹ́lẹ̀ wọlé dé gan-an ni.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ko le gba ijabọ naa ni bayi — o jẹ opin wa, kii ṣe tirẹ. Tun gbiyanju lẹẹkan si laipẹ, tabi daakọ ijabọ ti o wa loke sinu tikẹti kan.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'A kọ̀ láti gba ìròyìn náà (HTTP %d). Da a sọ́kè kí o sì ṣí tikẹ́tì kan, kí o sì tọka si nọ́mbà yẹn.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́nú àti àwọn iṣẹ́','User guides'=>'Àwọn ìtọ́nisọ́ olùṣe','Read the %s user guide'=>'Ka itọsọna olumulo %s','Hide this'=>'Fi eyi pamọ','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting fún WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, àwọn àfẹ́hìntì lójoojúmọ́, ìṣípòpadà ọ̀fẹ́ àti ìṣàkóso tó ṣeé lò fún àwọn èèyàn tó ń ṣe àwọn ojú òpó wẹ́bù tó lé ní ẹ̀ẹ̀kan.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Ọjà Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Ra ati ta awọn aaye, awọn agbegbe ati awọn aye ọna asopọ ti iṣeto, pẹlu owo ti o ni aabo titi ti awọn ẹgbẹ mejeeji yoo fi ni itẹlọrun.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — bẹ gba awọn eniyan ti o ṣe eyi fun igbesi aye kan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Ọjà àwọn olómìnira kárí ayé wa: wínilójú lórí ẹgbẹ̀rún mẹ́wàá iṣẹ́ tí a ti pèsè sílẹ̀ látọwọ́ àwọn akọ̀wé, apẹ̀rẹ̀, olùgbékalẹ̀ àti àwọn olùgbéga SEO, tàbí kí o gbé iṣẹ́ kalẹ̀ kí o jẹ́ kí wọ́n fún wa ní iye owó.','Media Offload'=>'Ìgbékáralé Mídíà','Connection'=>'Asiko isopo','What gets moved'=>'Ohun tí a máa kó lọ','How media is served'=>'Bẹ́ẹ̀ ni a ṣe ń pèsè àwọn ohun أṣọ́ mọ̀jìni','Move a batch now'=>'Gbe ipele kan bẹ́ẹ̀ lọ nísinsìnyí','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Awọn media ti a ti gbe lọ tẹlẹ ko ni ipa kankan nipasẹ iyipada kan nibi — adirẹsi rẹ ko yipada.','New uploads'=>'Àwọn ìgbélékè tuntun','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'Gbe awọn igbejade tuntun lọ si ibi ipamọ Zinn® bi wọn ṣe de','Existing media'=>'Awọn media ti o wa tẹlẹ','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Tẹ̀ síwájú láti máa gbé ibi ìpamọ́ àwọn media tí ó ti wà níhìn-ín lọ','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Ọ̀pọ̀ díẹ̀ àwọn fáìlì ní wákàtí kan, ní ẹ̀yìn-ọ̀gẹ̀dẹ, tí ó ń tẹ̀síwájú láti ibi tí ó ti dúró sí. Dípa pa èyí rẹ́ yóò mú kí ó sinmi; kò sí ohun tí a ti gbé lọ tẹ́lẹ̀ tí yóò padà bọ̀.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Awọn faili fun aago kọọkan','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Gbogbo asomọ jẹ awọn faili pupọ ati pe ọkọọkan jẹ ikojọpọ kikun. Gbe eyi sori olugbalejo iyara kan pẹlu opin ipaniyan oninurere; dinku rẹ ti awọn igbohunsafẹfẹ ba n ge kukuru.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Fi awọn faili silẹ ti o kere ju','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Awọn Kilobytes. Aami kekere kan n sanwo diẹ sii ni asopọ afikun ju bi o ṣe n fipamọ sinu disk, nitorinaa o ṣọwọn lati ni idi lati gbe ọkan lọ. Ṣeto si 0 lati gbe ohun gbogbo lọ.','Never move these types'=>'Má ṣe gbe irú àwọn wọ̀nyí lọ','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Wúlì wúlì nígbà tí plọ́gìn kan bá ka fáìlì kan tààrà láti orí disk — fọ́ọ̀tì kan, PDF kan tí olùṣẹ̀dá fọ́ọ̀mù fi sílẹ̀, fáìlì ohùn tí agbọ̀rọ̀sọ ń wá nínú rẹ̀.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Àwọn méjèèjì yìí ni àwọn tó yẹ kí o ṣọra fún — ka àpèjúwe kọ̀ọ̀kan kí o tó yí i padà.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Fi lati inu ibi ipamọ Zinn® ranṣẹ','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'Fi àwọn àdírẹ́sì àwòrán àti fáìlì sí ibi ìpamọ́ Zinn®','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'Pa, a ti gbe awọn faili soke ṣugbọn a n pese wọn lati saimi yii — eyiti o jẹ ipo aabo nigba ti o n ṣayẹwo pe ohun gbogbo ti de. Tan, a n pese awọn alejo lati ibi ipamọ ati pe saimi yii yoo da gbigbe ijabọ duro.','Free the disk space'=>'Tu aaye diskì náà','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Pa ẹ̀kọ́ agbègbè rẹ rẹ lẹ́ẹ̀kan ti gbogbo iwọn bá ti goke soke','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Èyí ni ojú àìnírọ̀rùn, ó sì tún jẹ́ ìdajì tí kò ṣeé yí padà. Fi í sílẹ̀ títí tí “Serve from Zinn® storage” yóò fi tanlẹ̀ tí o sì ti yẹ̀ ojú-wọ̀ ওয়েব rẹ wò — ẹ̀dà agbègbè rẹ nìkan ni ohun tí ó lè gbà ọ́là bí ohun kan bá kọjá.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'Paipa àwọn ẹ̀dà agbègbè rẹ kò ṣeé dá padà láti ojú-ìwé yìí. Kọ́kọ́ ṣe àkójọpọ̀ afẹ́fẹ́ kan — ẹ̀yọ ìsopọ̀ Zinn® Connector lè ṣe èyí fún ọ.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Aaye yii ko ti sopọ mọ ibi ipamọ Zinn® sibẹsibẹ, nitorinaa ko si ibi kankan lati gbe media lọ si.','%d attachment moved.'=>'Awon afikun %d ti yipada.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Aaye yii ko ni asopọ si ibi ipamọ Zinn®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Ko si ohun ti ko tọ — a ko tii so pọ ni. Awọn media duro lori seva yii titi ti a fi ṣe bẹẹ.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'Tẹ́ pọ̀, ṣùgbọ́n ìgbélékè tó kẹ́yìn kò yọrí sí rere.','Try a batch now'=>'Gbiyanju ìpele kan nísinsìnyí','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'Ti sopọ. Gbogbo àfikún ni a ti gbe lọ.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'A ti sopọ. Awọn afikun %1$s ninu %2$s wa sori sevpa yii tunṣe.','Moved so far'=>'Ti gbe lọ báyìí','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'Awọn faili %1$s, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Ṣì wà lórí sẹ́fà yìí','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s ninu %2$s awọn asomọ','Served from'=>'Ti a fi ranṣẹ lati','this server'=>'sẹ́fà ti a yìí','Connect this site'=>'So pọ̀ mọ́ ojula yii','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Storage → Media offload, and press “Pair a site”. Paste the code below.'=>'Ṣí daṣibọọdù Zinn Digital® rẹ, lọ si Ibi ipamọ → Ikojọpọ media, ki o si tẹ “Pair a site”. Lẹẹ koodu ti o wa ni isalẹ.','Pairing code'=>'Koodu ajọṣepọ','Disconnect this site'=>'Ge aju kuro lori aaye yii','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Àwọn ìgbélékè tuntun yóò wà lórí sínpà (server) yìí. Àwọn ohun amóhùn-máwòrán tí a ti ṣípò tẹ́lẹ̀ yóò máa ṣiṣẹ́ lọ — àdírẹ́sì wọn kì í yí padà.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'O ko ni igbanilaaye lati ṣakoso aaye yii.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ẹ lẹ́ koodu ìsopọ̀ láti ojú-iṣẹ́ Zinn Digital® rẹ.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Asopọ ti ni ilọsiwaju. Awọn igo tuntun yoo wa ni ipamọ pẹlu Zinn Digital® lati isinsinyi lọ, ati awọn media ti o wa tẹlẹ yoo gbe lọ ni abẹlẹ.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'Kò sopọ̀. Àwọn agbègbè rédíò tí a ti kó lọ tẹ́lẹ̀ máa ń ṣiṣẹ́ lọ́wọ́; àwọn ìgbélékè tuntun wà lórí sẹ́fà yìí.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'A kò le ka fáìlì yẹn láti orí sístà yìí, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a gbé sórí ẹ̀.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Ojula yìí kò lè ṣe ìgbohunsáfẹ́fẹ́ àgbélékè náà, nítorí náà kò sí ohun tí a ránṣẹ́.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Fáìlì yìí jẹ́ %1$s, bẹ́ẹ̀ sì ni PHP ojula yìí kò ní cURL, nítorí náà èyí tí ó tóbi jù lọ tí ó le fi sọ́kọ̀ ni %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'A ko le pari igbasoke naa.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Ibi ipamọ kọ igbaradi naa (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Àwọn àṣàyàn ẹ̀dá mímú','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Ìpìlẹ̀ ìbẹ̀rẹ̀ kan. Ohunkohun tó wà ní ìsàlẹ̀ yoo sọ ọ́ di asan.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Lo awon awco ati iwọn mi','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Fi eyi sile ti a o si lo apẹẹrẹ ti a ti ṣètò tẹlẹ gẹgẹ bi o ṣe wa.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Wo awọn akọsilẹ ifilọlẹ Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Ìgbàlàwé tí a ṣe àgbéjọ rẹ̀ kùnà àyẹ̀wò òtítọ́ rẹ̀, a kò sì fi sílẹ̀.']];